    "body_text": "Skip to Main Content\nRESIDENTS\nBUSINESS\nGOVERNMENT\nABOUT\nPERMITS\nHelp\nText Size: -A +A\nContents\n\nClick the plus (+) or minus (-) symbols to expand or collapse the entries. Click the checkboxes to select sections for saving or printing.\n\nRecently passed but uncodified ordinances are listed at the bottom of the ordinance table. Links to the ordinances are also available.\n\n\nClear all\n\n+\nTitle 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS\n\n+\nTitle 2 ADMINISTRATION AND FINANCE\n\n+\nTitle 3 REVENUE AND FINANCE\n\n–\nTitle 4 (Reserved)\n\n+\nTitle 5 BUSINESS LICENSES AND REGULATIONS\n\n+\nTitle 6 ANIMALS\n\n–\nTitle 7 (Reserved)\n\n+\nTitle 8 HEALTH AND SAFETY\n\n+\nTitle 9 PUBLIC PEACE, MORALS AND WELFARE\n\n+\nTitle 10 VEHICLES AND TRAFFIC\n\n–\nTitle 11 (Reserved)\n\n+\nTitle 12 STREETS, SIDEWALKS AND PUBLIC PROPERTY\n\n–\nTitle 13 (Reserved)\n\n–\nTitle 14 (Reserved)\n\n+\nTitle 15 BUILDINGS AND CONSTRUCTION\n\n–\nTitle 16 (Reserved)\n\n+\nTitle 17 SUBDIVISIONS\n\n+\nTitle 18 PLANNING AND ZONING\n\n+\nSTATUTORY REFERENCES FOR CALIFORNIA CITIES\n\n–\nCROSS-REFERENCE TABLE\n\n+\nORDINANCE TABLE\n\nAdvanced Search\nFremont Municipal Code\n\nA codification of the General Ordinances of the City of Fremont, California\n\nThe Fremont Municipal Code is current through Ordinance 02-2026, passed May 5, 2026.\n\nDisclaimer\n\nThe City Clerk’s office has the official version of the Fremont Municipal Code. Email the City Clerk’s office or call 510-284-4060 for records of ordinances passed after the date shown above.",
